Enum_List
	Define COMPOSITION_FRAME_ID_CREATED						For 0
	Define COMPOSITION_FRAME_ID_CONFIRMED					For 1
	Define COMPOSITION_FRAME_ID_COMPLETED					For 2
End_Enum_List

